   "parts": [
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">On Wednesday, April 26, 2017 at 2:02:29 AM UTC-4, Lu Zhang wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><font style=\"background-color:transparent\" color=\"rgb(34,34,34)\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> compileCode</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">f</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> code</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> language </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> language</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> verbose </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> verbose</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></font><br><font style=\"background-color:transparent\" color=\"rgb(34,34,34)\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"color:#000\"></span></font><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><font style=\"background-color:transparent\" color=\"rgb(34,34,34)\" face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Compilation</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ERROR</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">s</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">method</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">s</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> created</span><span style=\"color:#660\">!</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">/Rtools/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mingw_64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bin</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">g</span><span style=\"color:#660\">++:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> found<br>make</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">***</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fileb8437281799</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">o</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">127</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></font></div></code></div></div></blockquote><br></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">You appear to be running 32bit R on a 64bit system. Try executing this once:<br><br><pre>cat(<span><span>&#39;</span>Sys.setenv(BINPREF = &quot;C:/Rtools/mingw_32/bin/&quot;)<span>&#39;</span></span>,\r\n    <span>file</span> <span>=</span> file.path(Sys.getenv(<span><span>&quot;</span>HOME<span>&quot;</span></span>), <span><span>&quot;</span>.Rprofile<span>&quot;</span></span>), \r\n    <span>sep</span> <span>=</span> <span><span>&quot;</span><span>\\n</span><span>&quot;</span></span>, <span>append</span> <span>=</span> <span>TRUE</span>)</pre><br>Ben<br><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
